px;color:#64748b;line-height:1.6">You’re receiving this because you have a Ketravelan account.<br><br>If the button doesn’t work, copy this link:<br><a href="{{action_url}}" style="color:#2563eb;word-break:break-all">{{action_url}}</a><br><br><strong>The Ketravelan Crew</strong></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>', 'Feedback received

